          {
            "id": "cls-0005",
            "text": "<p>Chartered financial analyst with nine years in corporate finance and FP&amp;A across retail and logistics. I build forecasting models that management actually uses, and I explain the numbers in plain language. Led the budget process for a £1.2bn division and cut the monthly close from eight working days to four.</p>"
          }
        ]
      },
